<h1>Help & User Guide</h1>
<div class="container">
<h2>1. Logging In</h2>
<p>Use your assigned username and password to log in to the system from the homepage. If you forget your password, contact your administrator.</p>

<h2>2. Dashboard Overview</h2>
<p>The dashboard provides a quick view of:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Total Staff</li>
  <li>Total Customers</li>
  <li>Total Items</li>
  <li>Pending Bills</li>
</ul>
<p>Use the sidebar menu to navigate between different sections.</p>

<h2>3. User Management</h2>
<p>Manage your staff users and their roles:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Add new staff using the "Add Staff" button.</li>
  <li>Edit existing user information via the User Management page.</li>
  <li>Deactivate or remove users when necessary.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Customer Management</h2>
<p>Maintain customer records:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Add customers with the "Add Customer" option.</li>
  <li>View and update customer details.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Item & Category Management</h2>
<p>Manage inventory items and their categories:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Add, update or remove items.</li>
  <li>Create categories to organize your items better.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Billing & Reports</h2>
<p>Create bills and generate reports:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Create new bills from the Billing Management page.</li>
  <li>Track pending and completed bills.</li>
  <li>Print the bills</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
<div class="faq">
  <strong>Q: How do I reset my password?</strong>
  <p>A: Contact your administrator or use the "Profile" in the Dashboard and update your Password</p>

  <strong>Q: How do I add a new customer?</strong>
  <p>A: Navigate to the Customer Management section and click "Add Customer."</p>

  <strong>Q: Who do I contact for technical support?</strong>
